"Taeol's summoning apparatus is a formation of glowing metal, like circuit boards."
"The formation links gem-capped orbs to a carved stone disc set on a filigree arch."
"Taeol tailored his summoning to take one of receptive mind with expertise in science."
"The summoning voice speaks in the caster's tongue: 'A kinnar avi, nukol ad kayikxrokko...'"
"It then booms 'A KINNAR AVI. DANO DA NO JAILROAV UDLAKK DHO XAAK.' and 'DANO DA NO'."
"The passage between worlds is a black, airless vacuum without stars."
"The summoned arrive naked, carrying nothing across."
"Taeol summons Nathan Lark to his tower the week Nala lands on Elothia."
